local.description:
Sets up the sprayer over Bluetooth without a Petkit account: reads its id, derives the key it accepts and checks it by switching the sprayer's light on briefly.

Nearby Petkit devices found: {count}. Keep the sprayer within a few metres of a Bluetooth adapter or proxy.

{detail}

account.description:
Logs in once to download the sprayer's key, then works locally over Bluetooth. The password is not stored.

Country is your account's two-letter code (AE for the UAE uses Petkit's Asia server).

{detail}
